/**
 * {@link LmdbOperatorFeedbackStats#planningRevision()} is the version of the learned state planning can read, not the
 * observation clock: it advances exactly when a planner-visible learned value may have changed, and a publication that
 * changed nothing a planner reads leaves it (and with it every plan-cache entry compared against it) unchanged. The
 * observation clock keeps ticking once per accepted typed publication.
 */
